When applying B's mergeset (Estado(past(B))): the mergeset is applied in C-GD-05 order. Xa applies (liberation creates ID_LIB(1,n,a)). Xc is discarded with ErrNonce (same key nonce n already used by Xa). Xb's transfer spends ID_LIB(1,n,a), which exists → applies. Never a collision because ID_LIB(1,n,a) ≠ ID_LIB(1,n,b).

